    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Data Collection Facts Label\"\nexecute:\n  echo: false\n  warning: false\n  message: false\n---\n#please properly commit...\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n\n<style>\ntable.nutrition-label {\n  width: 75%;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\n  border: 2px solid black;\n  font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  margin-left: auto;\n  margin-right: auto;\n}\n\ntable.nutrition-label th,\ntable.nutrition-label td {\n  border: 1px solid black;\n  padding: 5px 7px;\n}\n\ntable.nutrition-label thead tr:nth-child(2) {\n  display: none;\n}\n</style>\n<table class=\"nutrition-label\">\n <thead>\n<tr><th style=\"border-bottom:hidden;padding-bottom:0; padding-left:3px;padding-right:3px;text-align: center; font-weight: bold; color: white !important;padding-right: 4px; padding-left: 4px; background-color: black !important;font-size: 18px;\" colspan=\"2\"><div style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; padding-bottom: 5px; \">Data Source Facts Label</div></th></tr>\n  <tr>\n   <th style=\"text-align:left;\">  </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:left;\">  </th>\n  </tr>\n </thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;color: white !important;background-color: black !important;font-size: 12px;width: 50%; \"> 1. Source Identity </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;color: white !important;background-color: black !important;font-size: 12px;width: 50%; \">  </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Source name </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Building Energy Benchmarking </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Domain/topic </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Energy and Water Consumption </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Source type </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Government Dataset </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;height: 26px;width: 50%; \">  </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;height: 26px;width: 50%; \">  </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;color: white !important;background-color: black !important;font-size: 12px;width: 50%; \"> 2. Collection Context </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;color: white !important;background-color: black !important;font-size: 12px;width: 50%; \">  </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Collector/producer </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> District of Columbia Department of Enerfy and Environment (DOEE) </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Original purpose </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> To track and public dissclose energy and water performance of buildings under Washington DC's Benchmarking law </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Collection method </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Enerygy Star, Adminstrative benchmarking progarm </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Record-creation event </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Required Annual Submition of energy and water consumption </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;height: 26px;width: 50%; \">  </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;height: 26px;width: 50%; \">  </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;color: white !important;background-color: black !important;font-size: 12px;width: 50%; \"> 3. Observation and Scope </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;color: white !important;background-color: black !important;font-size: 12px;width: 50%; \">  </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Unit of observation </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Individual building/properties reporting a record annually </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Population or objects represented </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Public and Private Buildings in Washington DC </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Time period covered </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> 2012-2025 </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Geographic area coverage </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Washington, District of Columbia via city/state/Zip code </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;height: 26px;width: 50%; \">  </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;height: 26px;width: 50%; \">  </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;color: white !important;background-color: black !important;font-size: 12px;width: 50%; \"> 4. Variables and Data Structure </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;color: white !important;background-color: black !important;font-size: 12px;width: 50%; \">  </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Main variables/fields </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Property ID and name, reporting year, report status, address, owner, ward, year built, property type, floor area, ENERGY STAR score, energy-use intensity, greenhouse gas emissions, water use, natural gas use, electricity use, latitude/longitude, verification information, and enforcement action </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Data types included </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Numerical, categorical/text, dates/timestamps, geographic coordinates, and identifiers </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Direct measurements </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Electricity use, natural gas use, water use, building floor area, geographic location, year built, and monthly electricity/natural-gas consumption </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Possible proxy variables </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Energy Star score, site EUI, property type, building size,greenhouse-gas emissions </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;height: 26px;width: 50%; \">  </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;height: 26px;width: 50%; \">  </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;color: white !important;background-color: black !important;font-size: 12px;width: 50%; \"> 5. Documentation </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;color: white !important;background-color: black !important;font-size: 12px;width: 50%; \">  </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Documentation found </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Data.gov </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Stated collection details </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11px;width: 50%; \"> Annual Benchmarking record, records marked as \"In Compliance\", \"Data Under Review by DOEE\", \"Exempt from this year's disclosure\", \"No Report Received\", or \"Incomplete Report\" </td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n",
